sequenceDiagram
  participant E as External ERP
  participant I as Integration Edge
  participant Q as Inbox / Queue
  participant V as Validator + Mapper
  participant D as SMART MANAGER Domain Service
  participant L as Ledger / Subledger
  participant O as Outbox / Event Publisher
  E->>I: POST /integrations/v1/{resource}
  I->>I: Authenticate, rate-limit, trace
  I->>Q: Store raw request + idempotency key
  Q->>V: Deliver normalized work item
  V->>V: Validate schema, tenant, references, version
  V->>D: Apply domain command
  D->>L: Post controlled financial effect when required
  D->>O: Record domain event + sync cursor
  O-->>E: Webhook delivery or pull acknowledgement
  I-->>E: 202 Accepted + correlation_id
